{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicGasEquilibriumConstants",
    "description": "The temperature-dependent equilibrium constants that set the vapour concentration at the surface of a MOSAIC particle, as SUBROUTINE update_thermodynamic_constants of chem/module_mosaic_therm.F (WRF v4.8.0) writes them, in the units ASTEM uses (nmol per m3 of air for the gas, mol per kg of water for the liquid). Each is fn_keq (template, mosaic_thermo_templates.esm): K(T) = K298 exp(a (tt - 1) + b (1 + ln tt - tt)), tt = 298.15/T.\n\nThe gas-liquid constants are Henry's-law constants converted from atmospheres to nmol per m3 by rt = R T (82.056 T / 1e15, m3 atm per nmol, both literals held at binary32): keq_nh3_gl (keq_gl(2), NH3(g) = NH3(aq)), keq_hno3_gl (keq_gl(3), HNO3(g) = H+ + NO3-) and keq_hcl_gl (keq_gl(4), HCl(g) = H+ + Cl-). keq_nh3_ll (keq_ll(2), NH3 + H2O = NH4+ + OH-) and k_w (keq_ll(3), water's ion product) are liquid-liquid. Combining them gives the constants of the two volatile ammonium salts in solution, kp_nh4no3 = K_w/(K_b K_H,NH3 K_HNO3) and kp_nh4cl likewise: the product of the two surface vapour concentrations over a solution whose NH4NO3 (NH4Cl) activity is 1. keq_sg_nh4no3 and keq_sg_nh4cl (keq_sg(1:2)) are the dissociation products of the SOLID salts, atm2 divided by rt^2 to (nmol/m3)^2.\n\nOnly temperature enters. These are the constants that astem_liquid_surface_equilibrium.esm and the dry-particle surface equilibria take as parameters; a consumer computes them here once per cell and couples them in.\n\nReference: the real64 values ASTEM itself held (ASTEM tape AIN record, fork branch earthsciml-instrumented-chem170), rel 1e-9.",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R.A., Easter, R.C., Fast, J.D., Peters, L.K. (2008). Model for Simulating Aerosol Interactions and Chemistry (MOSAIC). J. Geophys. Res. 113, D13204."
      },
      {
        "citation": "WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_therm.F, update_thermodynamic_constants"
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "MosaicGasEquilibriumConstants": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "./mosaic_thermo_templates.esm"
        }
      ],
      "subsystems": {
        "ap": {
          "ref": "./mosaic_astem_parameters.esm"
        },
        "mp": {
          "ref": "./mosaic_mesa_parameters.esm"
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "t_k": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 298.15,
          "description": "Air temperature t_k (rsub(ktemp), real32 promoted)."
        },
        "rt": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "R T in m3 atm per nmol, 82.056 T/1e15."
        },
        "keq_nh3_gl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_gl(2): NH3 Henry constant, (mol/kg) per (nmol/m3)."
        },
        "keq_hno3_gl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_gl(3): HNO3 dissolution-dissociation constant, (mol/kg)^2 per (nmol/m3)."
        },
        "keq_hcl_gl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_gl(4): HCl dissolution-dissociation constant, (mol/kg)^2 per (nmol/m3)."
        },
        "keq_nh3_ll": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_ll(2): NH3(aq) base dissociation, mol/kg."
        },
        "k_w": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_ll(3): ion product of water, (mol/kg)^2."
        },
        "kp_nh3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "kp_nh3 = K_w/(K_b K_H,NH3), (nmol/m3) per (mol/kg)... the factor that turns NH4+/H+ into surface NH3."
        },
        "kp_nh4no3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "kp_nh4no3 = kp_nh3/keq_hno3_gl: [NH3]s [HNO3]s over a solution of unit NH4NO3 activity, (nmol/m3)^2."
        },
        "kp_nh4cl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "kp_nh4cl = kp_nh3/keq_hcl_gl: [NH3]s [HCl]s over a solution of unit NH4Cl activity, (nmol/m3)^2."
        },
        "keq_sg_nh4no3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_sg(1): NH4NO3(s) = NH3(g) + HNO3(g), (nmol/m3)^2."
        },
        "keq_sg_nh4cl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "keq_sg(2): NH4Cl(s) = NH3(g) + HCl(g), (nmol/m3)^2."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "rt",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "ap.rt_c0",
                  "t_k"
                ]
              },
              "ap.rt_den"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "keq_nh3_gl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "fn_keq",
                "bindings": {
                  "k298": "ap.kh_nh3_298",
                  "a": "ap.kh_nh3_a",
                  "b": "ap.kh_nh3_b",
                  "t": "t_k",
                  "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
                }
              },
              "rt"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "keq_hno3_gl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "fn_keq",
                "bindings": {
                  "k298": "ap.kh_hno3_298",
                  "a": "ap.kh_hno3_a",
                  "b": "ap.kh_hno3_b",
                  "t": "t_k",
                  "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
                }
              },
              "rt"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "keq_hcl_gl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "fn_keq",
                "bindings": {
                  "k298": "ap.kh_hcl_298",
                  "a": "ap.kh_hcl_a",
                  "b": "ap.kh_hcl_b",
                  "t": "t_k",
                  "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
                }
              },
              "rt"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "keq_nh3_ll",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "fn_keq",
            "bindings": {
              "k298": "ap.kb_nh3_298",
              "a": "ap.kb_nh3_a",
              "b": "ap.kb_nh3_b",
              "t": "t_k",
              "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "k_w",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "fn_keq",
            "bindings": {
              "k298": "ap.kw_298",
              "a": "ap.kw_a",
              "b": "ap.kw_b",
              "t": "t_k",
              "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "kp_nh3",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "k_w",
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "keq_nh3_ll",
                  "keq_nh3_gl"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "kp_nh4no3",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "kp_nh3",
              "keq_hno3_gl"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "kp_nh4cl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "kp_nh3",
              "keq_hcl_gl"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "keq_sg_nh4no3",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "fn_keq",
                "bindings": {
                  "k298": "ap.ksg_nh4no3_298",
                  "a": "ap.ksg_nh4no3_a",
                  "b": "ap.ksg_nh4no3_b",
                  "t": "t_k",
                  "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
                }
              },
              {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  "rt",
                  2.0
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "keq_sg_nh4cl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "fn_keq",
                "bindings": {
                  "k298": "ap.ksg_nh4cl_298",
                  "a": "ap.ksg_nh4cl_a",
                  "b": "ap.ksg_nh4cl_b",
                  "t": "t_k",
                  "t_ref": "mp.t_ref"
                }
              },
              {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  "rt",
                  2.0
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
